      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPY ZENDEN (3) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 1.3 lengths at this track in a handy 23.44 beating Hybrid Eve. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Expected to be right there at the finish again. ASTON JOE (8) was a winner (19.06) at Temora two back but out of the placings last time when 8th at this track. Has the ability to give this a shake. BOGAN WHISKEY (5) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 18.61. Has a tricky draw to overcome but has the ability and in winning form. Should be in this for a long way. ROTO ROAD (1) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
